---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HandwrittenNote from '../components/HandwrittenNote.astro';
import Newsletter from '../components/Newsletter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="South African in Portugal. Collecting places, thoughts and things worth remembering.">
  <!-- Hero: Hi I'm Lea + Photo -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-semibold text-plum mb-6 leading-[1.05]">
          Hi, I'm Lea.
        </h1>
        <p class="font-heading text-xl lg:text-2xl italic text-espresso/70 mb-8">Welcome to my little corner of the internet.</p>
        <p class="text-espresso/70 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-lg">
          I'm a South African living in Portugal, happiest somewhere between a wild place and a really good cup of coffee.
        </p>
        <p class="text-espresso/70 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-lg">
          Life with Lea is my place to collect the things I never want to forget — places worth going, food worth travelling back for, thoughts I probably overthought, and all the little moments in between.
        </p>
        <p class="text-espresso/70 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
          I don't have life figured out. But I'm having a very good time figuring it out.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-sm overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/images/bio-portrait.webp"
            alt="Lea"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 lg:-bottom-6 lg:-left-6 bg-lavender/30 rounded-sm p-4 lg:p-6 max-w-[200px]">
          <span class="font-script text-wine text-xl block -rotate-2">coffee first.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- A Little More About Me — Lavender scrapbook -->
  <section class="bg-lavender/20 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-plum mb-10 text-center">A little more about me</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-wine font-medium whitespace-nowrap">currently calling</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/70">Portugal, home</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-wine font-medium whitespace-nowrap">originally from</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/70">South Africa</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-wine font-medium whitespace-nowrap">you'll usually find me</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/70">outside somewhere</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-wine font-medium whitespace-nowrap">coffee</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/70">non-negotiable</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-wine font-medium whitespace-nowrap">wine</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/70">yes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-wine font-medium whitespace-nowrap">ideal Saturday</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/70">coffee → market → somewhere beautiful → wine</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-wine font-medium whitespace-nowrap">always searching for</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/70">the place tourists haven't found yet</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-wine font-medium whitespace-nowrap">happy place</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/70">the South African bush</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3 sm:col-span-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-wine font-medium whitespace-nowrap">life philosophy</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/70">still working on that one</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-8">
        <span class="font-script text-wine text-xl -rotate-1 inline-block">probably planning the next trip →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Somewhere between here & home — South Africa & Portugal -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 lg:py-28">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-plum mb-14 text-center">Somewhere between here & home.</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      <!-- South Africa -->
      <div class="group">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-sm mb-6">
          <img
            src="/images/south-africa-about.webp"
            alt="South African bush landscape"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
          />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-semibold text-plum mb-1">South Africa</h3>
        <p class="font-script text-wine text-lg mb-3 -rotate-1">where I'm from.</p>
        <p class="text-espresso/80 leading-relaxed">
          It's where my love for wild places started. There's something about the bush that makes everything else go quiet.
          Early mornings, dusty roads, endless landscapes and that feeling of being somewhere much bigger than yourself.
          No matter how far I travel, it'll always feel like home.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Portugal -->
      <div class="group">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-sm mb-6">
          <img
            src="/images/portugal-about.webp"
            alt="Lisbon tiled streets"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
          />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-semibold text-plum mb-1">Portugal</h3>
        <p class="font-script text-wine text-lg mb-3 -rotate-1">where life is now.</p>
        <p class="text-espresso/80 leading-relaxed">
          Portugal has become the place where I'm building my life. It's slow mornings over coffee, spontaneous weekends
          somewhere new, long lunches, ocean air, tiled streets and discovering that there is almost always a good glass
          of wine nearby. Living here has also given me one of my favourite things: a whole new part of the world to explore.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Things I take very seriously — Full-width plum/lavender -->
  <section class="bg-plum py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-cream mb-10">Things I take very seriously</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-cream/80 text-lg">Finding the best coffee within walking distance.</p>
        <p class="text-cream/80 text-lg">Ordering the thing on the menu I've never tried before.</p>
        <p class="text-cream/80 text-lg">Sunsets.</p>
        <p class="text-cream/80 text-lg">Window seats.</p>
        <p class="text-cream/80 text-lg">A good glass of wine.</p>
        <p class="text-cream/80 text-lg">Taking the scenic route.</p>
        <p class="text-cream/80 text-lg">Saving approximately 47 places on Google Maps before every trip.</p>
        <p class="text-cream/80 text-lg">And finding places that make you think, <em class="text-lavender">how did I not know this existed?</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Life isn't just the places you go — Emotional centerpiece -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-plum mb-10">Life isn't just the places you go.</h2>

      <div class="text-espresso/80 leading-relaxed space-y-5 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        <p>
          I've always loved collecting things — not <em>things</em> exactly, but moments.
        </p>
        <p>
          A coffee somewhere I can't pronounce. A road through the middle of nowhere. A conversation over a bottle of wine. A sunset that makes everyone go quiet for a second.
        </p>
        <p>
          The tiny details you don't realise are going to become memories until they already have.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm learning that a good life probably isn't one big extraordinary thing. It's a collection of very ordinary things that somehow become extraordinary when you look back.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="font-heading text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-plum italic">
        This is where I'm keeping mine.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- So, where should we go next? -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-plum mb-12 text-center">So, where should we go next?</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-10">
      <a href="/go" class="group block p-6 rounded-sm border border-lavender/30 hover:border-plum/30 transition-colors">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-plum mb-1 group-hover:text-wine transition">Travel guides →</h3>
        <p class="font-script text-wine text-lg mb-2">Take me somewhere.</p>
        <p class="text-espresso/70 text-sm">Travel guides, weekend escapes, hidden places and the occasional detour that turns out better than the plan.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/eat-drink" class="group block p-6 rounded-sm border border-lavender/30 hover:border-plum/30 transition-colors">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-plum mb-1 group-hover:text-wine transition">Food & drink →</h3>
        <p class="font-script text-wine text-lg mb-2">Show me what's worth ordering.</p>
        <p class="text-espresso/70 text-sm">Coffee shops, restaurants, markets, wine farms and the things I'd happily travel back for.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/live" class="group block p-6 rounded-sm border border-lavender/30 hover:border-plum/30 transition-colors">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-plum mb-1 group-hover:text-wine transition">Lifestyle stories →</h3>
        <p class="font-script text-wine text-lg mb-2">The everyday stuff.</p>
        <p class="text-espresso/70 text-sm">Life lately, little favourites, routines and everything that doesn't quite fit into a travel guide.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/think" class="group block p-6 rounded-sm border border-lavender/30 hover:border-plum/30 transition-colors">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-plum mb-1 group-hover:text-wine transition">Thoughts & ideas →</h3>
        <p class="font-script text-wine text-lg mb-2">Stay for the overthinking.</p>
        <p class="text-espresso/70 text-sm">Creativity, work, growing up, figuring things out and whatever else has been taking up space in my head.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sign-off -->
  <section class="py-12 text-center">
    <p class="font-heading text-xl italic text-espresso/60 mb-3">see you somewhere beautiful,</p>
    <p class="font-script text-3xl text-plum">Lea x</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
